# 根式的運算（題目卷＋解析卷）
R=[
(r'若 \(\sqrt7+\sqrt7=\sqrt N\)，則 \(N=\)？',['7','14','28','42'],'C',r'\(\sqrt7+\sqrt7=2\sqrt7=\sqrt{4\times7}=\sqrt{28}\)，所以 \(N=28\)。'),
(r'化簡 \((\sqrt7+\sqrt5)^2(\sqrt5-\sqrt7)^2=\)？',['4','0','2','−4'],'A',r'\(=[(\sqrt5+\sqrt7)(\sqrt5-\sqrt7)]^2=[(\sqrt5)^2-(\sqrt7)^2]^2=(5-7)^2=(-2)^2=4\)'),
(r'設 \(A=(\sqrt7+\sqrt3)(\sqrt7-\sqrt3)\)，\(B=\sqrt3\times\sqrt7\)，\(C=\sqrt3+\sqrt7\)，則 A、B、C 的大小關係為何？',['A＞B＞C','C＞B＞A','B＞A＞C','B＞C＞A'],'D',r'\(A=(\sqrt7)^2-(\sqrt3)^2=7-3=4=\sqrt{16}\)，\(B=\sqrt{21}\)，\(C=\sqrt3+\sqrt7\)。\n\(A^2=16\)，\(B^2=21\)，\(C^2=10+2\sqrt{21}\)。\n因為 \(4<\sqrt{21}<5\)，所以 \(18<C^2<20\)，得 \(B^2>C^2>A^2\)，即 \(B>C>A\)。'),
(r'若 \(\sqrt3=a\)，\(\sqrt{30}=b\)，則 \(\sqrt{2.7}=\)？',[r'\(\dfrac{b-a}{10}\)',r'\(\dfrac{b-a}{\sqrt{10}}\)',r'\(\dfrac{3}{10}b\)',r'\(\dfrac{3}{10}a\)'],'C',r'\(\sqrt{2.7}=\sqrt{\dfrac{270}{100}}=\dfrac{\sqrt{270}}{10}=\dfrac{3\sqrt{30}}{10}=\dfrac{3}{10}b\)'),
(r'化簡 \(\sqrt{2^6\times3^7\times5^9\times7^9\times11^{12}}=\)？',[r'\(2^6\times3^7\times5^8\times7^9\times11^{11}\)',r'\(2^2\times3^2\times5^3\times7^3\times11^4\sqrt3\)',r'\(2^3\times3^3\times5^4\times7^4\times11^6\)',r'\(2^3\times3^3\times5^4\times7^4\times11^6\sqrt{3\times5\times7}\)'],'D',r'\(=\sqrt{(2^3)^2\times(3^3)^2\times3\times(5^4)^2\times5\times(7^4)^2\times7\times(11^6)^2}\)\n\(=2^3\times3^3\times5^4\times7^4\times11^6\sqrt{3\times5\times7}\)'),
(r'已知 \(a=\sqrt6+2\)，\(b=\sqrt6-2\)，則 \(a^2+ab+b^2\) 的值是多少？',['16','18','22','24'],'C',r'\(a+b=2\sqrt6\)，\(ab=(\sqrt6)^2-2^2=2\)。\n\(a^2+ab+b^2=(a+b)^2-ab=(2\sqrt6)^2-2=24-2=22\)'),
(r'若 \(\sqrt x\) 與 \(\sqrt3\) 是同類方根，則 x 可能為下列何數？',['9','27','18','63'],'B',r'\(\sqrt9=3\)，\(\sqrt{27}=3\sqrt3\)，\(\sqrt{18}=3\sqrt2\)，\(\sqrt{63}=3\sqrt7\)。\n只有 \(3\sqrt3\) 與 \(\sqrt3\) 是同類方根。'),
(r'由查表知 \(\sqrt{23}\approx4.796\)，\(\sqrt{230}\approx15.166\)，求 \(\sqrt{2.3}\approx\)？',['4.796','0.4796','15.166','1.5166'],'D',r'\(\sqrt{2.3}=\sqrt{\dfrac{230}{100}}=\dfrac{\sqrt{230}}{10}\approx\dfrac{15.166}{10}=1.5166\)'),
(r'若 \(\sqrt{10+10+10+10+10+10+10+10+10}=\sqrt{10}+\sqrt{10}+\cdots=a\times\sqrt{10}\)，則 \(a=\)？',['3','5','7','9'],'A',r'原式 \(=\sqrt{9\times10}=\sqrt{3^2\times10}=3\sqrt{10}\)，所以 \(a=3\)。'),
(r'化簡 \(\sqrt{72}-\sqrt{18}+\sqrt{27}-\sqrt{75}=\)？',[r'\(\sqrt6\)',r'\(-3\sqrt2\)',r'\(3\sqrt2-2\sqrt3\)',r'\(-2\sqrt2+3\sqrt3\)'],'C',r'原式 \(=6\sqrt2-3\sqrt2+3\sqrt3-5\sqrt3=3\sqrt2-2\sqrt3\)'),
(r'已知 \(\sqrt{71200}\approx266.833281\)，若 \(\sqrt x\approx2.668332\)，則下列哪個數最接近 x？',['7120','712','71.2','7.12'],'D',r'\(\sqrt x\approx2.668332\approx\dfrac{1}{100}\times266.833281\approx\dfrac{1}{100}\times\sqrt{71200}\)\n兩邊平方：\(x\approx\dfrac{1}{10000}\times71200=7.12\)'),
(r'下列哪一個選項裡的兩個根式是同類方根？',[r'\(7\sqrt3\) 與 \(3\sqrt7\)',r'\(\sqrt8\) 與 \(-2\sqrt2\)',r'\(\sqrt{125}\) 與 \(\sqrt{50}\)',r'\(\sqrt{18}\) 與 \(\sqrt{12}\)'],'B',r'(B) \(\sqrt8=2\sqrt2\)，與 \(-2\sqrt2\) 同類。\n(C) \(\sqrt{125}=5\sqrt5\)，\(\sqrt{50}=5\sqrt2\)；(D) \(\sqrt{18}=3\sqrt2\)，\(\sqrt{12}=2\sqrt3\)，都不同類。'),
(r'若 \(\dfrac{2}{\sqrt{13}-\sqrt{11}}=a\sqrt{13}+b\sqrt{11}\)，則 \(a+b=\)？',['0','1','2','3'],'C',r'\(\dfrac{2}{\sqrt{13}-\sqrt{11}}=\dfrac{2(\sqrt{13}+\sqrt{11})}{(\sqrt{13}-\sqrt{11})(\sqrt{13}+\sqrt{11})}=\dfrac{2(\sqrt{13}+\sqrt{11})}{2}=\sqrt{13}+\sqrt{11}\)\n\(a=1\)，\(b=1\)，\(a+b=2\)。'),
(r'已知 \(\sqrt5\approx2.236\)、\(\sqrt{10}\approx3.162\)、\(\sqrt{50}\approx7.071\)，請計算 \(\sqrt{0.4}\) 的值約為多少？',['0.6324','0.8324','1.0324','1.2324'],'A',r'\(\sqrt{0.4}=\sqrt{\dfrac25}=\sqrt{\dfrac{10}{25}}=\dfrac{\sqrt{10}}{5}\approx\dfrac{3.162}{5}=0.6324\)'),
(r'下列哪一個算式的結果最大？',[r'\(\left(\sqrt{\dfrac85}\right)^2\)',r'\(\sqrt{\dfrac{3}{16}}\div\sqrt{\dfrac13}\)',r'\(\sqrt7\div\sqrt{\dfrac{7}{25}}\)',r'\(\sqrt{\dfrac65}\times\sqrt{\dfrac{10}{3}}\)'],'C',r'(A) \(\dfrac85\)\n(B) \(\sqrt{\dfrac{3}{16}\times3}=\sqrt{\dfrac{9}{16}}=\dfrac34\)\n(C) \(\sqrt{7\times\dfrac{25}{7}}=\sqrt{25}=5\)\n(D) \(\sqrt{\dfrac65\times\dfrac{10}{3}}=\sqrt4=2\)\n最大的是 (C)。'),
(r'設 \(\sqrt{150}=12.2474\)，若 \(\sqrt x=1.22474\)，則 \(x=\)？',['15000','1500','15','1.5'],'D',r'\(\sqrt x=\dfrac{12.2474}{10}=\dfrac{\sqrt{150}}{10}\)，兩邊平方：\(x=\dfrac{150}{100}=1.5\)'),
(r'計算 \(3\sqrt5-3\sqrt{12}-\sqrt{80}+3\sqrt3-\sqrt{48}+4\sqrt{125}=\)？（化簡為最簡根式）',[r'\(-\sqrt5-3\sqrt3-\sqrt{48}+4\sqrt{125}\)',r'\(-19\sqrt3-7\sqrt5\)',r'\(\sqrt{77}\)',r'\(19\sqrt5-7\sqrt3\)'],'D',r'原式 \(=3\sqrt5-6\sqrt3-4\sqrt5+3\sqrt3-4\sqrt3+20\sqrt5=19\sqrt5-7\sqrt3\)'),
(r'利用附表求 \(\sqrt{0.15}\) 的近似值為何？\n\(\begin{array}{c|c|c} N & N^2 & \sqrt N\\\hline 15 & 225 & 3.872\\ 16 & 256 & 4.000\\ 17 & 289 & 4.123\end{array}\)',['225','3.872','2.25','0.3872'],'D',r'\(\sqrt{0.15}=\sqrt{\dfrac{15}{100}}=\dfrac{\sqrt{15}}{10}\approx\dfrac{3.872}{10}=0.3872\)'),
(r'\((\sqrt7+\sqrt5)^8(\sqrt7-\sqrt5)^7\) 的值與下列何者相同？',['−2',r'\(128\sqrt7+128\sqrt5\)','2',r'\(128\sqrt7-128\sqrt5\)'],'B',r'\(=(\sqrt7+\sqrt5)\times[(\sqrt7+\sqrt5)(\sqrt7-\sqrt5)]^7\)\n\(=(\sqrt7+\sqrt5)\times(7-5)^7=(\sqrt7+\sqrt5)\times128=128\sqrt7+128\sqrt5\)'),
(r'計算 \(\sqrt{\dfrac{21}{10}}\div\sqrt{\dfrac{35}{3}}\times\left(-\sqrt{\dfrac{125}{2}}\right)\) 可得下列哪一個結果？',[r'\(-\dfrac{3\sqrt5}{2}\)',r'\(\dfrac{3\sqrt5}{2}\)',r'\(-\dfrac{\sqrt5}{2}\)',r'\(\dfrac{\sqrt5}{2}\)'],'A',r'\(=-\sqrt{\dfrac{21}{10}\times\dfrac{3}{35}\times\dfrac{125}{2}}=-\sqrt{\dfrac{9\times5}{4}}=-\dfrac{3\sqrt5}{2}\)'),
(r'求 \(\dfrac{\sqrt5}{\sqrt2}\times\dfrac{2}{\sqrt3}\div\dfrac{\sqrt{125}}{\sqrt{12}}=\)？',[r'\(2\sqrt2\)',r'\(\sqrt{10}\)',r'\(\dfrac{2\sqrt2}{5}\)',r'\(\dfrac{\sqrt{10}}{5}\)'],'C',r'\(=\dfrac{\sqrt5}{\sqrt2}\times\dfrac{\sqrt4}{\sqrt3}\times\dfrac{\sqrt{12}}{\sqrt{125}}=\sqrt{\dfrac52\times\dfrac43\times\dfrac{12}{125}}=\sqrt{\dfrac{8}{25}}=\dfrac{2\sqrt2}{5}\)'),
(r'(甲) \(\sqrt2+\sqrt3=\sqrt5\)；(乙) \(\sqrt{10}-\sqrt2=\sqrt8\)；(丙) \(\sqrt2\times\dfrac23=\sqrt{2\times\dfrac23}\)；(丁) \(\sqrt5\div2=\sqrt{5\div4}\)。上列各項計算方法，正確的有多少個？',['1 個','2 個','3 個','4 個'],'A',r'(甲)(乙) 不是同類方根，不能合併。\n(丙) \(\sqrt2\times\dfrac23=\sqrt2\times\sqrt{\dfrac49}=\sqrt{2\times\dfrac49}\)，所以錯。\n(丁) \(\sqrt5\div2=\sqrt5\div\sqrt4=\sqrt{5\div4}\)，正確。\n只有 (丁) 正確。'),
(r'將下列各數化成最簡根式後，與 \(-2\sqrt3\) 為同類方根的數共有多少個？\n\(\sqrt{18}\)、\(-\dfrac{5}{\sqrt3}\)、\(\sqrt{90}\)、\(\sqrt{\dfrac{21}{5}}\)、\(\sqrt{512}\)、\(\sqrt{\dfrac34}\)、\(\dfrac{\sqrt2}{\sqrt3}\)',['1','2','3','4'],'B',r'\(\sqrt{18}=3\sqrt2\)，\(-\dfrac{5}{\sqrt3}=-\dfrac{5\sqrt3}{3}\)（同類），\(\sqrt{90}=3\sqrt{10}\)，\(\sqrt{\dfrac{21}{5}}=\dfrac{\sqrt{105}}{5}\)，\(\sqrt{512}=16\sqrt2\)，\(\sqrt{\dfrac34}=\dfrac{\sqrt3}{2}\)（同類），\(\dfrac{\sqrt2}{\sqrt3}=\dfrac{\sqrt6}{3}\)。\n共 2 個。'),
(r'若 \(\sqrt x=2\sqrt3\)，\(\sqrt y=3\sqrt2\)，則 \(x+y=\)？',['36','30','29','10'],'B',r'\(\sqrt x=2\sqrt3\Rightarrow x=12\)；\(\sqrt y=3\sqrt2\Rightarrow y=18\)。\(x+y=30\)。'),
(r'若 a、b 為整數，且 \(2(\sqrt{50}-\sqrt{24})-3(\sqrt{96}-\sqrt{32})=a\sqrt6-b\sqrt2\)，則 \(a-2b=\)？',['60','28','−28','−60'],'B',r'原式 \(=2(5\sqrt2-2\sqrt6)-3(4\sqrt6-4\sqrt2)=10\sqrt2-4\sqrt6-12\sqrt6+12\sqrt2=22\sqrt2-16\sqrt6\)\n所以 \(a=-16\)，\(b=-22\)，\(a-2b=-16+44=28\)。'),
]
